    `is a citizen` IS TRUE
    `holds a valid permit or pass` IS FALSE
    `is transiting` IS FALSE

`a pass-holder whose presence is undesirable` MEANS NoBoardFacts WITH
    `the ground` IS `presence would be undesirable`
    `is a citizen` IS FALSE
    `holds a valid permit or pass` IS TRUE
    `is transiting` IS FALSE

`a visitor whose presence is undesirable` MEANS NoBoardFacts WITH
    `the ground` IS `presence would be undesirable`
    `is a citizen` IS FALSE
    `holds a valid permit or pass` IS FALSE
    `is transiting` IS FALSE

