`a PR abroad who applied in time and was granted` MEANS PRAbroad WITH
    `outside Singapore without a valid re-entry permit` IS TRUE
    `applied within the prescribed period` IS TRUE
    `applied before the period began and it was pending or later rejected` IS FALSE
    `the application was rejected` IS FALSE

`a PR abroad who never applied` MEANS PRAbroad WITH
    `outside Singapore without a valid re-entry permit` IS TRUE
    `applied within the prescribed period` IS FALSE
    `applied before the period began and it was pending or later rejected` IS FALSE
    `the application was rejected` IS FALSE

`a PR abroad refused a permit` MEANS PRAbroad WITH
    `outside Singapore without a valid re-entry permit` IS TRUE
    `applied within the prescribed period` IS TRUE
    `applied before the period began and it was pending or later rejected` IS FALSE
    `the application was rejected` IS TRUE

`a PR abroad who applied early, still pending` MEANS PRAbroad WITH
    `outside Singapore without a valid re-entry permit` IS TRUE
    `applied within the prescribed period` IS FALSE
    `applied before the period began and it was pending or later rejected` IS TRUE
    `the application was rejected` IS FALSE

`a PR at home` MEANS PRAbroad WITH
